{"id":"n29316-1-10","stage":3,"title":"배고프다 · 肚子饿","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29316-1-10-1","ko":"아. 배고파. 벌써 점심시간이 다 되었네.","zh":"啊，我饿了。午饭时间都快到了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아.","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배고파.","meaning":"肚子饿","explanation":"배고프다：肚子饿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"배고프다","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29316","senseId":"1","lemma":"배고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점심시간이","meaning":"午饭时间","explanation":"점심시간：午饭时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"점심시간","audio":"/audio/f9c6099aa3e3f9379de4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26896","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었네.","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"8186b5026911737a","term":"배고프다","zh":"肚子饿","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3","entryId":"29316","definition":"感到肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["배고프다"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"f9c6099aa3e3f937","term":"점심시간","zh":"午饭时间","audio":"/audio/f9c6099aa3e3f9379de4.mp3","entryId":"26896","definition":"吃中饭的时间。","pronunciation":["점ː심씨간"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a338b64ce4b8219f7e7b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29316-1-10-2","ko":"강아지도 배고플 테니 밥 주는 걸 잊지 마.","zh":"小狗也会饿的，别忘了喂它饭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"강아지도","meaning":"小狗，狗崽","explanation":"강아지：小狗，狗崽；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"강아지","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15689","senseId":"1","lemma":"강아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배고플","meaning":"肚子饿","explanation":"배고프다：肚子饿；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"배고프다","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29316","senseId":"1","lemma":"배고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"테니","meaning":"表示打算、推测或意志。","explanation":"터：表示打算、推测或意志。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"터","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72183","senseId":"1","lemma":"터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饲料，食儿","explanation":"밥：饲料，食儿","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"3","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주는","meaning":"使感到，使受到，带来","explanation":"주다：使感到，使受到，带来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"3","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잊지","meaning":"忘，忘记，忘却","explanation":"잊다：忘，忘记，忘却；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"잊다","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70067","senseId":"1","lemma":"잊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryId":"15689","definition":"狗的崽子。","pronunciation":["강아지"]},{"id":"8186b5026911737a","term":"배고프다","zh":"肚子饿","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3","entryId":"29316","definition":"感到肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["배고프다"]},{"id":"cfabc7b0ff6f800c","term":"터","zh":"表示打算、推测或意志。","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3","entryId":"72183","definition":"表示打算、推测或意志。","pronunciation":["터"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饲料，食儿","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"动物吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"使感到，使受到，带来","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"让别人经历某事或产生某种情绪。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"b0566314f635fe32","term":"잊다","zh":"忘，忘记，忘却","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3","entryId":"70067","definition":"本来知道的事情记不住或记不起来。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/32051be0239840057ef1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29316","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7681,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊，我饿了。午饭时间都快到了呢。","小狗也会饿的，别忘了喂它饭。","后辈们好像在排挤我。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["啊，我饿了。午饭时间都快到了呢。","小狗也会饿的，别忘了喂它饭。","后辈们好像在排挤我。"],"answer":1}]}
